1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:04,138
(Sheldon:)I hope that's a rhetorical question
because I have no clue.

2
00:00:06,487 --> 00:00:08,647
Mm. This is great, what's the occasion?

3
00:00:08,823 --> 00:00:12,053
(Leonard:)No occasion.
Things have been a little weird between us...

4
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:14,786
(Leonard:)...so I wanted to throw together
a fun night for you.

5
00:00:14,963 --> 00:00:16,893
- That is so sweet.
- I got your favorites:

6
00:00:17,065 --> 00:00:21,295
(Leonard:)Beer, wings, sliders, we can watch
the football game. I even painted my stomach.

7
00:00:24,138 --> 00:00:26,398
- Go sports?
- Well?

8
00:00:26,574 --> 00:00:30,014
(Leonard:)In case you were in the mood for baseball,
I didn't wanna look ridiculous.

9
00:00:30,745 --> 00:00:33,505
- This is awesome, I love it.
- Good, I'm glad.

10
00:00:33,681 --> 00:00:36,051
(Penny:)I worked my ass off,
so this is what I needed.

11
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,240
(Leonard:)Great, just relax and enjoy.
Tonight is all about you.

12
00:00:39,454 --> 00:00:40,854
(Penny:)Ah. Thank you.

13
00:00:44,559 --> 00:00:47,149
(Leonard:)So where exactly are we
in this relationship?

14
00:00:48,696 --> 00:00:51,526
(Penny:)Oh, come on, I just told you
I had a hard day.

15
00:00:51,699 --> 00:00:54,689
- You're right, I'm sorry. Let's watch the game.
- Great.

16
00:00:57,038 --> 00:01:01,018
(Leonard:)Just know, the longer we wait
to talk about it the weirder it gets.

